{"excerpt_id":"ex_ff9fbb4f8527_015","source_id":"src_ff9fbb4f8527","source_hash":"8125bad030ffebd4e20366121c83e0487c06c33b2fe5eb554bd3e84f45b6aafa","text":"Change the URI field of a dynamic NFT to update the supporting data for the NFT. Only the issuer, or their authorized minter, can modify an NFT, and only if it was minted with the Mutable flag enabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 227","char_start":4636,"char_end":4837,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:34:00.991Z"}
